  "description": "TUnit-native gRPC assertions for .NET tests. Fluent ThrowsGrpcException / DoesNotThrowGrpcException on a delegate, with StatusCode shorthands (IsUnavailable, IsNotFound, and the rest) and WithDetail / WithDetailContaining refinements, plus the IsRpcException discriminator and the GrpcCallBuilder test-double helper from the framework-agnostic core. AOT-compatible, trimmable, no runtime reflection in the assertion path.",
